uced by a single non-recursive activation wave.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D2/1/code.py:256:# --------------- generator (a2_single_wave) ---------------\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/195c6913/D15/1/code.py:3:# Change: 所有标记独立且同时模拟（单步处理），无顺序依赖或迭代。... → 碰撞后发射新粒子（链式反应）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/52/code.py:17:#      touches the green block only at a corner is now a valid gateway. The path wave is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/52/code.py:19:#    - Sorting is intentionally decoupled from that path wave: once maroons are known to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/52/code.py:160:    - Keep only maroon pixels reached by that wave, but rank them by Euclidean distance to the red center rather than by flood-fill distance; ties break by row then column.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/a47bf94d/D13/0/code.py:3:# Change: 单步变换——每个token独立执行一次分解和传输操作，各通道之间没有顺序依赖... → 链式反应传播\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/20/code.py:3:# Name: 碰撞变色+链式反应\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:34:      - 原版一趟扫描就能结束；融合后这个前提失效，必须显式维护 `known markers` 与按波次推进的 `wave frontier`。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:181:    first_wave_only: bool = False,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:187:    wave = list(roots)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:188:    waves: list[list[tuple[int, int, int, int]]] = []\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:190:    while wave:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:199:        next_wave_map: dict[tuple[int, int], int] = {}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:201:        for r, c, marker_color in wave:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:215:            prev_pending = next_wave_map.get((nr, nc))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:217:                next_wave_map[(nr, nc)] = donor_color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:219:                assert prev_pending == donor_color, \"same-wave spawned marker must be color-consistent\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:221:        waves.append(placements)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:222:        if first_wave_only:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:225:        wave = []\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:226:        for (r, c), marker_color in sorted(next_wave_map.items()):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:228:            wave.append((r, c, marker_color))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:230:    return out, waves\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:233:def _single_wave_output(shape: tuple[int, int], roots: list[tuple[int, int, int]]) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:234:    out, _ = _render_from_roots(shape, roots, donor_mode=\"all_known\", first_wave_only=True)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:243:    fused_out, fused_waves = _render_from_roots(g.shape, roots, donor_mode=\"all_known\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:245:    first_wave_out = _single_wave_output(g.shape, roots)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:247:    total_placed = int(sum(len(wave) for wave in fused_waves))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:248:    recolored = int(sum(marker_color != donor_color for wave in fused_waves for _, _, marker_color, donor_color in wave))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:251:    for wave in fused_waves:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:252:        for _, _, marker_color, donor_color in wave:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:261:       