xels block the square, forcing it to stop short.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1328253125/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:190:  \"path\": \"blue pixels \\\"water channel\\\" that is wide enough to pass through until \\\"stuck\\\" because of too narrow\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1328253125/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:191:  \"dst\": \"reach same sized red square or \\\"get stuck\\\" on the way where the blue path is too narrow\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1328253125/5/codegen_prompts/2.md:133:- bg background; rectangular frame on right with colored markers on its edges; sprites in a narrow left strip separated by a constant-color divider column.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1328253125/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:264:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1328253125/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:355:- bg background; rectangular frame on right with colored markers on its edges; sprites in a narrow left strip separated by a constant-color divider column.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1328253125/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:259:- bg background; rectangular frame on right with colored markers on its edges; sprites in a narrow left strip separated by a constant-color divider column.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/code/eval/seed1328253125/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:291:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
